WEBVTT

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.200
Anything you have changed
may warp the space and time,

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.040
and rewrite the future.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.660
But there's an exception.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.160
At some point in time,
there is an important node.

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:46.000
Even if you accidentally alter
all the previous course,

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.830
but if there's no change about the
result of what happened at the node.

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:49.910
Then

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.700
nothing will be changed.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.580
Last night at 2030 hour,

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:55.950
7.8 magnitude earthquake
occurred in Fengchuan County.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.790
The focal depth is 15 kilometers.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.330
Strong tremor in many places.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.410
The earthquake caused other natural
disasters such as mountain collapse.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.200
I am now located in Linjiang Town,
Fengchuan County, the worst-hit disaster.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.750
We can see that the
local rescue plan has started.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.410
Search and rescue work are proceeding.

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:11.500
Within 4 hours after the earthquake,

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.620
several buried people have been rescued
from the rubble one after another.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.620
But the specific number
of people affected,

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.200
no detailed statistics are available yet.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.290
No matter how the process changes,

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.910
they are all doomed

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.910
in the final result!

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:29.370
Am I right?

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:34.660
Auntie, just stay at home.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.950
I'll be back later!

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.750
What?! What did you call me?

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.000
Auntie?!

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.910
It's dark outside, where are you going?

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.450
Cheng Xiaoshi,
you can't save them!

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:49.000
They are already dead.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.120
What you are seeing is just
a little piece of the past!

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:56.790
What's more, death is an important node
that can't be crossed.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:00.080
No matter how hard you try,
their destiny can't be turned around.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:03.330
And it could even cause--

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:07.330
the disappearance of
the life we have now!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.410
Xiao Xiao,
why are your hands trembling nonstop?

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:18.120
It's so hot today,
yet your hands are ice cold.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.160
Are you sick?

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.080
I'm fine.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.750
There must be something wrong.

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:29.250
Let go.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.790
Luckily, it's not fever.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.040
I just remembered.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:43.200
I forgot to tell Hongbin
something important.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:44.330
I'll be right back.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.000
Don't worry.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.290
It's still late at night.
Can't you leave it until school tomorrow?

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:57.830
Lu Guang.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:00.200
You told me they're dead.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.120
But the warmth from the hand.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.790
It's so real.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:07.040
Cheng Xiaoshi, think carefully.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:11.160
If you tell everyone about the earthquake,
how much panic it will cause?

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:14.790
By the time,
the result could be worse.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:33.370
♬ Wind, you have to blow gently ♬

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:39.370
♬ Bird, you have to sing softly ♬

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:41.080
♬ My little baby ♬

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.250
♬ My little baby ♬

00:04:54.250 --> 00:04:58.660
♬ Is about to fall asleep ♬

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:03.080
♬ Baby's eyes are like mum's ♬

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.160
Lu Hongbin,

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.750
I think you hit your head.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.080
Can you feed yourself with playing ball?

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.330
Eat yourself then.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.700
From today onwards,
I don't care about your food anymore.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:29.950
Don't eat then.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.410
Who's scared?

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.250
Hey, what's with this?

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:37.830
Isn't this child usually reliable?

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.950
The kid is still growing.

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:43.580
How can you not let him eat?

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:45.370
These kids are obsessed
with playing basketball.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.330
How can you think of
that as the future, silly?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.910
Cheng Xiao? Why'd you come?

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.540
Leave, quickly.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:56.580
Are you kidding me?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.080
My knee hasn't recovered yet.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:58.950
Where can I go?

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.370
Cheng Xiao.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.290
He's like that already,
where are you taking him?

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.830
You're the one who led him astray, right?

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:08.910
Aunty, that's not what I meant.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.000
But you really have to hurry up.

00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.750
Driving us away？

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.830
What do you mean!

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.950
Chen Xiao, what are you talking about?

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:18.330
Lu Hongbin, please.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:21.080
Bring Liu Meng and leave
the town immediately! Hurry up!

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.870
Perhaps you want to go
play the tournament now?

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:27.200
There's still two weeks left.
What's with the hurry?

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.870
What to play?

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:31.250
The school decided to demolish
the court long time ago.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.620
Today is the last game.

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:33.500
Crap.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:34.830
Teacher Ma didn't mention any of that.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.080
--Who do you think you are?
--Teacher Ma--

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.410
That's enough. Leave if you want to.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.120
I'm trying to help you all.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:41.580
Don't think because you had
a glorious moment today

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.910
you can tell others what to do!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:45.000
Brother, calm down.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.500
I'm sure he has a reason, too.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.580
Tonight at 8:30 p.m.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.450
There will be an earthquake.

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:55.370
Liu Meng, isn't your dad in the city?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:56.410
Contact him right away.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.290
And stay there for the night.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.830
Okay.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.330
You're secretly contacting
your dad behind my back.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.450
Mum, I haven't decided.

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:08.000
Decided what?

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.910
You really want to go study in the city.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.620
Tell him to give up!

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.830
If you wanna follow
this heartless bastard,

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:15.450
then don't think of me as your mum.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.540
Mum, didn't she say
she hasn't decided yet?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:19.000
Both of you.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.080
One always dream of playing in the city.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.660
The other wants to study in the city.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.120
I worked so hard to raise you both up.

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:24.950
What do I want?

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.080
Mum, stop making trouble.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:28.160
Me making trouble?

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.660
Let the neighbours have a say.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.000
Who is the sorry one?

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.500
What you say and do will cause commotion,

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.830
making the past more unpredictable.

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.700
You can't save who are
destined to die tonight.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:48.830
And possibly kill those who are innocent.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.870
Someone said there will be
an earthquake tonight.

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:55.080
Is it true?

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:56.910
Where did he hear from?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.040
But it is weird tonight.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:00.450
So hot.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:01.450
That's right,

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.950
--my dog barked for the whole day.
--Mine too, like crazy.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.330
Is it the premonition of an earthquake?

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.580
Yes, dogs are spiritual.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:11.290
If it's real...

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.250
Cheng Xiao, are you crazy?

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.910
Why should there be an earthquake?

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.450
Be... Because.

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:22.580
That's right, where did it come from?

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:24.620
Hey.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.200
--Tell us.
--If there is,
we need to evacuate the town.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.370
Don't simply spread the news.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.250
--Earthquakes have levels, too.
--What if it's a small scale one?

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.120
It will become a joke
if the town is alarmed.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.950
What is happening?

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:35.870
Yeah, what if it's a rumour?

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.580
Yeah, really.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.450
It's written in a magazine.

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:58.120
How can you take the words
in books seriously?

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.080
Good thing we didn't believe it,

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.950
or it will become a real joke.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.950
Cheng Xiao, you're going?

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.790
You should study hard.
Learn some serious knowledge.

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.410
Such a kid.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.330
I want to save them.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:42.250
Save everyone.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.870
We can't control what has happened.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:46.120
Lift your head,

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.500
and look forward.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.700
Lu Guang.

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.830
Can you save my mum?

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:55.950
Only one.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.750
Can you please let me save her only?

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.410
All right.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.410
I'll tell you what you should do.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.410
Thank you, Lu Guang.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.500
Earthquake?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.660
I went to Lu Hongbin's house.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:16.910
The rumour has the town overflowed.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:19.080
Doesn't matter if it's real or not.
Let's just get ready.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.330
Hey, wait a minute.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.450
I'll go and pack some stuff.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.620
Don't take it if the disaster is imminent.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:29.330
The earthquake also caused
a mountain collapse

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:31.540
and buried half of the town.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:33.790
It's more dangerous to escape outside.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:37.120
Cheng Xiao was saved
when he was at the dining room.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:44.540
Brother, are you still mad at mum?

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:47.870
I'm not, the sky looks pretty tonight.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.830
I'll watch it for a while.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.580
Mum ask me to bring some rice to you.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.080
I'm not hungry.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.750
Starve yourself then.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.660
What did Cheng Xiao say after you
mentioned studying in the city?

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.910
I couldn't care less what he thinks about.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.200
Why'd you still tell him then?

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:07.370
It's almost 8:30 p.m.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:10.000
I won't help you if you
can't finish your work.

00:11:13.870 --> 00:11:16.910
An earthquake will happen
tonight at 8:30 p.m.

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:23.750
Stop packing.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.790
All can be earned back
when we save our lives.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:28.000
All right, I'm almost done.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:34.790
No time, wait no more.

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.410
Hey, kid.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:42.660
Say, Liu Meng.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:45.750
There won't be
an earthquake tonight, right?

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.080
Huh, I trusted you.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.040
Where is the earthquake?

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.790
Playing hide and seek at such late hours.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:09.330
Lu Guang, will the
earthquake never happen?

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.910
Oh no, I forgot something.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:16.450
Don't move, I'll take it for you.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.500
Ah! Mum!

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.290
Liu Meng, Mum!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.830
Xiao Xiao!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.080
Don't come out!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:16.200
Xiao Xiao, are you all right?

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:18.620
I'm good, what about you?

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:24.620
I'm fine, just a little tired

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.910
and I wanna rest.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.500
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:31.910
exit the picture if it's too hard for you.

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:41.120
Son, don't be afraid.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:43.580
Mum is here.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:46.500
You'll be fine when I'm here.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.410
Xiao Xiao,

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:56.000
Mum doesn't know much.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:14:00.540
--Bad memories, bad temper.
--Stop smoking in the house. Get out.

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.000
Look at our son suffocating.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:07.830
I only know a few dishes
that your dad loves.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.290
Mum didn't study much.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:15.750
Can't teach you anything.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.000
The only thing I can do

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.080
is support my two favourite people.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.790
To do the things they like.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:26.120
So Xiao Xiao,

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:30.700
if you like to play, go and play.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.660
Go to the city if you want to.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.910
Don't blame me for being too selfish.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:42.250
I'm just reluctant when
I thought of you leaving.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:46.660
When you were young,

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:53.410
I can imagine your face.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:02.120
♬ Wind, you have to blow gently ♬

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.120
--♬ Bird, you have to sing softly ♬

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:05.200
--I'm scared of the dark,
mum stay with me.
--♬ Bird, you have to sing softly ♬

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.700
--I'm scared of the dark,
mum stay with me.
--♬ My little baby ♬

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:10.700
Xiao shi don't be afraid.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.200
Mum is here.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:15.950
♬ My little baby ♬

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:19.830
♬ Is about to fall asleep ♬

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:25.830
♬ Baby's eyes are like mum's ♬

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:09.870
Mum!

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:18.000
I'm scared, I'm scared of dark.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.370
I'm scared of being alone!

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:31.040
I heard a cry, there might be
people down there.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.410
--Here, someone is here!
--Move the machine here.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:38.870
Mum! The help is here! Wake up! Please!

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:40.910
It's open! There's two down there.

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.910
Hold that rock, don't let it collapse.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:45.540
Comrade reporter.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:46.080
--Here is under construction
to rescue you can't pass.

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.750
--This is my house,
--Here is under construction
to rescue you can't pass.

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.830
I want to find my wife and kid.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.910
Within 4 hours after the earthquake,

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:55.040
several buried people have been rescued
from the rubble one after another.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.620
But the specific number
of people affected,

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.410
--My mum is still inside, please save her.
--no detailed statistics
are available yet.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:00.750
Student, please calm down.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.120
Leave the rest for us.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:04.660
She's still alive.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:08.040
Please, save her quick.

00:17:13.330 --> 00:17:14.830
Save her.

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.330
Hurry up and leave.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:30.250
Farewell, my dearest.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:51.660
I'm sorry.

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:53.250
Why do you lie to me?

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:56.160
Why do you still want her dead?

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.410
In order to make everything stay the same.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.330
If I can't save them,

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:37.160
then what's the point
of delivering the words?

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.160
After so many years.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:54.080
If I could've cought the bus
back to town earlier that day,

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.450
the result may be different.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.660
Fool.

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.080
I have said,

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:03.000
past or future,

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.950
because we can't change the past.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:08.750
When I was cleaning the house yesterday,

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.500
I unexpectedly found these old things.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.910
I thought it was buried by the earthquake.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:30.080
Hi, can I print photos
from the old camera here?

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.620
Sure, what film is that?

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:37.660
Oh the film is still in there, but...

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:42.540
Don't question the future,

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.700
as the future will change

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:47.500
because of us.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.160
The camera is a little damaged.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:51.370
See if you still can print it.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.330
Oh no, I forgot something.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.660
Don't move, I'll take it for you.

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:00.290
Camera, the camera.

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:13.120
Leader, I have something to say.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:17.160
I've been dreaming recently
about the tournament with Long Yang.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.160
As your substitute,

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.330
scoring three pointers and dunking.

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:23.790
Beating the opponent.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.580
I woke up

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:29.000
and miss the days
when we could play together.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.040
When I grow up,

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.580
I will still play on the court.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:37.330
But without you guys
who take turns to play with.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:40.620
The guys who blame me
for not shooting well.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:44.120
Without those, you are still
willing to pass the ball to me.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:47.370
The court

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:51.080
will never be the same again.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:53.540
So.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.700
Chen Xiao, come play together.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.790
Come here quick.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.540
Thank you, leader.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.830
It's your perseverance.

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:05.410
Allow me to add
the memories of friendship.

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:10.410
Hey, are you two
anode and cathode?

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.910
Get closer.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.000
Liu Meng.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:19.790
When I heard you wanted to go to the city,

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:23.870
I was really happy for you.

00:21:25.370 --> 00:21:30.160
The city has better education,
and better development prospects.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:33.250
I hope you can go as soon as possible.

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.910
Immediately, it's best to leave right now.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:38.790
And I will

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.450
be admitted to a school
in the city not long after.

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:48.000
Then... catch up to you.

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:51.750
Okay! Pinkie promise!

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:09.290
Mum, I'm just a substitute.

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:10.830
While taking photos, let me go please.

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:15.200
This is your dad's
first camera, don't break it.

00:22:16.450 --> 00:22:19.000
Your dad said he liked
taking pictures back then.

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:22.080
I bought this using
half a year of savings.

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:24.330
Didn't you hate dad taking pictures?

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:26.750
I do hate him.

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:29.200
Taking pictures of others
with the camera all day.

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:32.540
Come, take one for your mum.

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:34.750
See if the camera is still usable.

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:13.660
♬ Wind, you have to blow gently ♬

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:18.910
♬ Bird, you have to sing softly ♬

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:42.040
♬ Baby's mouth ♬

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:48.120
♬ Like dad and mom ♬

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.200
What are you two doing?

00:23:57.200 --> 00:23:58.750
Stop doing as you like.

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:02.790
Just want some rest,
the studio will operate as usual.

00:24:03.700 --> 00:24:06.620
Cheng Xiaoshi, are you in this, too?

00:24:10.660 --> 00:24:14.080
All right then, let me know
when you're done resting.

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:17.580
Excuse me,

00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:21.370
Is there an old witch
able to enter picture's time?

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:23.870
Sorry, but there isn't such service.

00:24:23.870 --> 00:24:27.620
Neither a witch, please find someone else.

00:24:27.620 --> 00:24:30.120
I'm Xiao Li, police.
